body:
@Osirisa @AnityEx Can you test with installing the Android SDK by using the command line tools instead of Android Studio, and see if the issue is reproducible.
This will allow us to narrow whether the SDK or the IDE is the source of the crashes.

See [these instructions](https://github.com/GodotVR/godot_openxr_vendors/blob/master/demo/addons/godotopenxrvendors/plugin.gdextension#L4) for installing the Android SDK using `sdkmanager`.
